Dialogue: 1,0:04:40.01,0:04:44.39,Tittle,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(1000,1000)}盖塔同盟军
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.98,0:23:39.98,Tittle结尾,,0,0,0,,龙的血 人的心
